{"_id":"50c59ee72d694ed1","name":"Resonance Echo","type":"ability","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"You are now a psychedelic being of swirling multicolored vapor that resembles your living body and clothes. You may weakly interact with the physical world and vice versa. You're vulnerable to paranormal powers and electroplasmic effects. You move about by floating and may fly swiftly without tiring. You may slowly flow through small openings as a vapor. You change the temperature around you and are mind-bending for the living to behold. You are affected by spiritbane charms (take 2 Drain to overcome the repulsion), but not many people still carry these. You have less effect under the light of bluetime. Whenever you would take Stress, take Drain instead. When you would deadlock a key, choose an echo irregularity instead.","class":"Ghost","class_default":"Ghost","price":"1","purchased":false},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"permission":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"f3e9bb76e730abc5","name":"Dissipate","type":"ability","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"You can disperse the vapor of your ghostly form in order to pass through solid objects for a moment. Take 1 Drain when you dissipate, plus 1 Drain for each feature: It lasts longer (a minute—an hour—a day)—you also become invisible—anything that passes through your form becomes dangerously electrified or frozen.","class":"Ghost","class_default":"Ghost","price":"1","purchased":false},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"permission":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"338710833305ad2c","name":"Manifest","type":"ability","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"Take 1 Drain to flow through the electroplasmic pathways of the resonance field in order to instantly travel to any place you knew intimately in life, or to answer the summoning call when compelled.","class":"Ghost","class_default":"Ghost","price":"1","purchased":false},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"permission":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"f3a8e7bd1076c4f7","name":"Poltergeist","type":"ability","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"Take 1 Drain to strongly interact with the physical world for a few moments (as if you had a normal body). Extend the reach and magnitude of your interaction to include telekinetic force and electroplasmic discharges by taking more Drain (2-6).","class":"Ghost","class_default":"Ghost","price":"1","purchased":false},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"permission":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"ba130202fb948705","name":"Possess","type":"ability","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"You may Attune to the resonance field in order to take control of a living body. When your control is challenged, you must re-Attune (risking electroplasmic harm) or leave the body. Your control is challenged when: you consume resonance energy from the host—when paranormal powers act against you—when the host's will is driven to desperation. You may easily and indefinitely possess a hollow or hull that has been prepared for you. If it's a hollow, switch to the Vampire playbook. If hull, switch to the Hull playbook, keeping your previous action ratings. Immediately take one Hull trait, and fill two memory clocks (choose from your previous character's special abilities instead of rolling randomly). To remember more than what those two clocks give you will require filling more memory clocks, as usual.","class":"Ghost","class_default":"Ghost","price":"1","purchased":false},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"permission":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"a4569f9d3a204ff9","name":"Versatile","type":"ability","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"Choose a special ability from another source (can be taken more than once).","class":"","class_default":"","price":"1","purchased":false},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"permission":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"c49553d0854f76a8","name":"Hound's Instincts","type":"ability","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"When you push yourself, you can also do one of the following: figure out where to go next, even with zero leads—make someone stop and listen to you for a few moments, no matter how unlikely it is.","class":"Hound","class_default":"Hound","price":"1","purchased":false},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"permission":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"99a12e62794fa930","name":"Learn the Hard Way","type":"ability","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"Whenever you take harm, clear an amount of Stress equal to the harm level, and it counts as a successful gather information roll (with a level of detail equal to the harm level). The GM will tell you what you learn.","class":"Hound","class_default":"Hound","price":"1","purchased":false},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"permission":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"1dd61bdfddd9f785","name":"Just a Scratch","type":"ability","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"Harm doesn’t slow you down during a score, and never factors into effect (level 4 harm is still fatal, and you still roll for harm complications). You gain potency when you Consort with someone who has caused you to mark harm.","class":"Hound","class_default":"Hound","price":"1","purchased":false},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"permission":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"f6703bf6fa959ca1","name":"Fixer","type":"ability","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"During downtime, you get +1 result level when you Acquire Asset or Reduce Heat. When incarcerated, take +1d to any real time prison rolls, or take +2d to a prison time skip roll.","class":"Hound","class_default":"Hound","price":"1","purchased":false},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"permission":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"4fb3124d3b62795d","name":"In Too Deep","type":"ability","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"Once per score, you can Consort with an NPC to form an intimate bond. If you have such a bond with someone involved in a score, you get +1d and potency to any actions dealing with them.","class":"Hound","class_default":"Hound","price":"1","purchased":false},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"permission":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"f7a2506744787dec","name":"Echo Pet","type":"ability","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"Your pet is imbued with anomalous resonance. It gains potency when tracking or fighting the paranormal, and gains a paranormal ability: time-glitching, mind-link, or mirror-field. Take this ability again to choose an additional paranormal ability for your pet.","class":"Hound","class_default":"Hound","price":"1","purchased":false},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"permission":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"3878dfd22f05afef","name":"Dogged Persistence","type":"ability","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"Twice per score, you may use your tenacity to resist a consequence of exhaustion or mental harm (fear, confusion, losing track of someone) or to push yourself for influencing someone or searching for clues.","class":"Hound","class_default":"Hound","price":"1","purchased":false},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"permission":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"76e185f56701b3f1","name":"Automaton","type":"ability","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"You are a soul powering a robotic body. You have human-like strength and senses, by default. Your frame has built-in armor (this doesn't count for your load). Your former human feelings, interests, and connections are almost entirely gone (you start with no keys). You may be repaired if damaged or destroyed. Whenever you would take Stress, take Drain instead. Choose two frame features.","class":"Hull","class_default":"Hull","price":"1","purchased":false},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"permission":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"52c56b76bfc8fdcc","name":"A Room of Your Own","type":"ability","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"You have your own secret little den. You can now put stacks into bank. You have a pet. You can spend a downtime action to look after the pet (describe the lengths you go to), and mark 3 xp in a memory clock (below) of your choice.","class":"Hull","class_default":"Hull","price":"1","purchased":false},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"permission":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"252711bd1689c9a9","name":"Powerhouse","type":"ability","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"Take 1 Drain to perform a feat of extreme strength or speed (run faster than an autopod, rend metal with your hands, etc.). This factors into effect.","class":"Hull","class_default":"Hull","price":"1","purchased":false},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"permission":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"2894c8b21196157f","name":"Retractable Arsenal","type":"ability","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"Your items are built into your frame and may recess beneath panels out of sight. Your frame can now carry +2 load.","class":"Hull","class_default":"Hull","price":"1","purchased":false},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"permission":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"f5c604251e42dbe4","name":"Energy Beam","type":"ability","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"You may release some of your energy as an electric shock around you or as a directed beam. You may also use this ability to create a lightning barrier to repel or trap a resonance entity. Take 1 Drain for each level of magnitude.","class":"Hull","class_default":"Hull","price":"1","purchased":false},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"permission":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"0ce191f3c3c47a4f","name":"Interface","type":"ability","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"You may Attune to the local electroplasmic power field to control it or something connected to it (including another hull).","class":"Hull","class_default":"Hull","price":"1","purchased":false},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"permission":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"a1395ac515ed3a32","name":"Frame Upgrade","type":"ability","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"Choose two additional frame features. This trait may be taken twice.","class":"Hull","class_default":"Hull","price":"1","purchased":false},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"permission":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"3f93b739a64a30fa","name":"Unalloyed Genius","type":"ability","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"When you craft an invention, take +1 result level to the roll. Invention clocks start with 1 segment already filled.","class":"Intellectual","class_default":"Intellectual","price":"1","purchased":false},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"permission":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"0f38a844fddddb00","name":"Mentalist","type":"ability","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"You can deduce trivial details about anyone. Study them to reveal their current intentions as well as a deep desire they’re keeping secret or didn’t even know they had; gain +1d and potency when acting on this information.","class":"Intellectual","class_default":"Intellectual","price":"1","purchased":false},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"permission":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"c28056f99bdff529","name":"High-Functioning Insomniac","type":"ability","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"During downtime, you get two ticks to distribute among any long-term project clocks that involve research, investigation, or crafting.","class":"Intellectual","class_default":"Intellectual","price":"1","purchased":false},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"permission":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"e5ed9138762df168","name":"Try Not to Break It This Time","type":"ability","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"Any flashbacks to give another crew member just the right gadget before the score cost 0 Stress. Gain one free downtime action to craft such a gadget in a flashback.","class":"Intellectual","class_default":"Intellectual","price":"1","purchased":false},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"permission":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"2a451c7662b58032","name":"Researcher","type":"ability","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"Twice per score, you may use your research to resist a consequence of fatigue, weakness, or resonance effects, or to push yourself when working with technical skill or handling resonance objects.","class":"Intellectual","class_default":"Intellectual","price":"1","purchased":false},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"permission":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"81c5494f3b470d10","name":"Anatomist","type":"ability","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"You can Tinker the human body to treat wounds or stabilize the dying. You may Study a sickness or corpse. Everyone in your crew gets +1d to their healing treatment rolls.","class":"Intellectual","class_default":"Intellectual","price":"1","purchased":false},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"permission":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"470fe7a596a5c702","name":"Encyclopedic Knowledge","type":"ability","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"When you push yourself, you can also do one of the following: instantly find a weak point or exploitable pattern in an obstacle—dazzle an audience with your intellect, leaving them confused and distracted.","class":"Intellectual","class_default":"Intellectual","price":"1","purchased":false},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"permission":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"dde6bacca54f5b2d","name":"Advanced Sparkmind","type":"ability","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"Choose an additional type, or add an edge, or remove a flaw.","class":"Intellectual","class_default":"Intellectual","price":"1","purchased":false},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"permission":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"20c3e835ad68e7b3","name":"Clean","type":"ability","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"Twice per score, you may use your precision to resist a consequence from detection or security measures, or to push yourself for a feat of athletics or stealth.","class":"Operative","class_default":"Operative","price":"1","purchased":false},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"permission":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"4df81bc14938a57a","name":"Double Agent","type":"ability","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"You gain a second backing faction of your choice immediately. You get +2d when working on long-term projects to influence any of your backing factions. How long have you been secretly building this relationship? Does your first backing faction know about it?","class":"Operative","class_default":"Operative","price":"1","purchased":false},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"permission":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"f400c709afc58b9e","name":"Dead Drop","type":"ability","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"You have access to a bound resonance entity who will leave up to 2 load of items anywhere you need them. The flashback to requesting the item(s) is free, and they’re left anywhere you choose. You can also flashback to an Acquire Asset roll for the items as a free downtime activity.","class":"Operative","class_default":"Operative","price":"1","purchased":false},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"permission":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"118493f358e75ab9","name":"Echo Walker","type":"ability","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"Pay 2 Stress to step into the resonance field and disappear. Reappear at a moment of your choice, wherever you want (you have to be able to move there physically). When you reappear you are so cold (level 1 harm, can be resisted).","class":"Operative","class_default":"Operative","price":"1","purchased":false},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"permission":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"78bcd2894e5612e5","name":"Wetwork","type":"ability","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"When you push yourself, you can also do one of the following: make an improbable shot at extreme distance or with extreme speed—perform a feat of athletics that verges on the superhuman.","class":"Operative","class_default":"Operative","price":"1","purchased":false},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"permission":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"93387cf3e41f2182","name":"Cipher","type":"ability","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"You have a deep cover identity. When you use it, you get +1d to rolls to confuse or deflect suspicion. When you reveal your true identity, the resulting surprise gives you the initiative in the situation (as well as +1d and potency). If your cover identity is blown, create a new one with a 4-segment long-term project.","class":"Operative","class_default":"Operative","price":"1","purchased":false},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"permission":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"2c6e929610646440","name":"Sleeper Agents","type":"ability","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"Once per score, pay 2 Stress and nominate a minor NPC. They’ve been working for you this whole time.","class":"Operative","class_default":"Operative","price":"1","purchased":false},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"permission":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"f707c04cf49b92c6","name":"Control","type":"ability","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"Choose one of your action ratings. When you lead a group action using that action, you can suffer only 1 Stress at most regardless of the number of failed rolls, and you may count multiple 6s from different rolls as a critical.","class":"Operative","class_default":"Operative","price":"1","purchased":false},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"permission":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"60f7eec277e36d0b","name":"Third Eye Opened","type":"ability","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"You’re always aware of resonance entities in your vicinity. You can Attune to the resonance field to force a nearby entity to appear and obey a command you give it.","class":"Paranormalist","class_default":"Paranormalist","price":"1","purchased":false},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"permission":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"afbb6481b810ef6b","name":"Precognition","type":"ability","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"Two times per score, you can assist a teammate without paying Stress. Tell us how you prepared for this in advance.","class":"Paranormalist","class_default":"Paranormalist","price":"1","purchased":false},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"permission":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"7f99d879955fd4bb","name":"Psychokinesis","type":"ability","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"When you push yourself, you can also do one of the following: levitate for a short time—violently push or pull objects through the air.","class":"Paranormalist","class_default":"Paranormalist","price":"1","purchased":false},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"permission":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"7886b9f9fae406f0","name":"Extrasensory Perception","type":"ability","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"Twice per score, you may use your sixth sense to resist a paranormal consequence, or to push yourself when you deal with paranormal forces.","class":"Paranormalist","class_default":"Paranormalist","price":"1","purchased":false},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"permission":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"1b7f63fee46273f0","name":"Forbidden Science","type":"ability","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"You can use a downtime action to perform a paranormal experiment to manifest a supernatural effect or being. Gain one free downtime action to perform such experiments.","class":"Paranormalist","class_default":"Paranormalist","price":"1","purchased":false},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"permission":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"e75d048a2178c6fe","name":"Echo Projection","type":"ability","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"Pay 2 Stress to become a radiant being of crackling energy. While in this mode, you count as wearing armor, your physical attacks gain potency, and you can push yourself to shoot arcs of electroplasmic lightning. The projection drops at the end of the scene (or pay 2 Stress to continue for another scene). When you drop the projection, take the level 2 harm Drained and the GM will tick a clock of their choice (you may resist these consequences). If you take this ability a second time, the GM will not tick a clock.","class":"Paranormalist","class_default":"Paranormalist","price":"1","purchased":false},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"permission":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"e2fa449b4063e2af","name":"Medium","type":"ability","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"You can communicate with all paranormal entities, even those not present in the physical realm. Take +1d and potency when you do.","class":"Paranormalist","class_default":"Paranormalist","price":"1","purchased":false},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"permission":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"1e3ad0756cae0103","name":"Parapsychology","type":"ability","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"You're immune to the terror that paranormal entities inflict on sight. Take +1d to resistance rolls with Resolve. Take +1d when you gather info about the paranormal.","class":"Paranormalist","class_default":"Paranormalist","price":"1","purchased":false},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"permission":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"c11a770ff009fec9","name":"True Believer","type":"ability","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"Twice per score, you may use your conviction to resist a consequence of law-breaking (being arrested or hassled by Bluecoats, etc.) or to push yourself when fighting for your ideology.","class":"Radical","class_default":"Radical","price":"1","purchased":false},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"permission":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"7d464e5a95b8ee45","name":"Direct Action","type":"ability","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"When you make a desperate roll with either Wreck or Command, you gain both potency and scale. Remember that you can trade position for effect to make almost any action desperate, if you dare.","class":"Radical","class_default":"Radical","price":"1","purchased":false},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"permission":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"b96238b02d741bb2","name":"Echo Chamber","type":"ability","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"The resonance echoes of the downtrodden are drawn to you, and when you open yourself to them, your poetry reverberates with their power. Whenever you loudly recite poetry, a crowd gathers to listen (if possible). When you use poetry as a means to an end, take +1d, and gain potency dealing with the paranormal.","class":"Radical","class_default":"Radical","price":"1","purchased":false},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"permission":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"12dbf29f9444565f","name":"Fellow Travelers","type":"ability","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"In any scene with more than one NPC, ask the GM which of them are sympathetic to your cause. It’s always at least one, but often a few, many, or sometimes all of them.","class":"Radical","class_default":"Radical","price":"1","purchased":false},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"permission":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"4b3ec691714e8097","name":"Polemicist","type":"ability","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"When you push yourself, you can also do one of the following: whip a crowd into a righteous fury—shame a powerful figure into silence or retreat.","class":"Radical","class_default":"Radical","price":"1","purchased":false},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"permission":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"9f5e63b290996913","name":"Praxis","type":"ability","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"If you loudly and visibly destroy a symbolic target during a score, gain +2 result levels to any long-term project rolls related to your revolutionary work during the following personal business phase.","class":"Radical","class_default":"Radical","price":"1","purchased":false},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"permission":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"c11b7776ffa671ff","name":"Pamphleteer","type":"ability","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"You can publish revolutionary literature as a 4-segment long-term project. Name each work. Once complete, a published work can tick another long-term project clock related to the revolution, once per downtime (maximum of four such works may be in effective circulation). If you die or get imprisoned, each work adds two ticks.","class":"Radical","class_default":"Radical","price":"1","purchased":false},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"permission":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"d36a0afb9f22a169","name":"Total Dedication","type":"ability","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"When you roll a desperate action, you get +1d to your roll if you also take -1d to any resistance rolls against consequences from your action.","class":"Radical","class_default":"Radical","price":"1","purchased":false},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"permission":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"7e738ac572d10c0c","name":"Here Goes Nothing","type":"ability","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"Take 2 Stress to roll your Sway or Consort rating while performing a different action. Use a free flashback to reveal who you convinced to teach you this particular technique or approach.","class":"Swinger","class_default":"Swinger","price":"1","purchased":false},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"permission":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"a5f6faca2da6af26","name":"Yeah, Baby","type":"ability","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"When you agree to an NPC’s proposal, even though it complicates the crew’s goals, everyone else on the crew marks 1 xp while you clear 3 Stress.","class":"Swinger","class_default":"Swinger","price":"1","purchased":false},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"permission":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"0b13d9ac14ecd177","name":"Groove Machine","type":"ability","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"You always know where the nearest music is playing and when you start dancing, others feel compelled to join. When you take action while moving it on the dance floor, take +1d and potency.","class":"Swinger","class_default":"Swinger","price":"1","purchased":false},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"permission":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"d9ac3574fd5c9ff3","name":"Improviser","type":"ability","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"When you push yourself, you can also do one of the following: claim to be anyone and others will consider the possibility, no matter how outlandish—plunge blindly in an unexpected direction and find a new path.","class":"Swinger","class_default":"Swinger","price":"1","purchased":false},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"permission":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"e5d50489e035a52e","name":"Always Hustling","type":"ability","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"Every personal business phase, mark +1 bank, and you may give yourself or another crew member +1 downtime action. What’s your side hustle?","class":"Swinger","class_default":"Swinger","price":"1","purchased":false},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"permission":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"7c4066b6a8c2b89a","name":"Party Animal","type":"ability","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"When you Indulge Vice, you can invite an ally to join you. They do not need to spend their own downtime action, and lose the same Stress that you do. One time during the next score, they can assist you once for free.","class":"Swinger","class_default":"Swinger","price":"1","purchased":false},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"permission":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"c3224366501ed154","name":"Echo Twin","type":"ability","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"There’s an alternate version of you in the resonance field, ghostly and glitched out. Take 2 Stress to summon them for a few moments, plus 1 Stress for each additional feature: They last for a scene rather than a few minutes—they appear completely stable and solid—they obey your instructions to the letter.","class":"Swinger","class_default":"Swinger","price":"1","purchased":false},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"permission":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"1b3012a3e9ffd9af","name":"Smooth","type":"ability","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"Twice per score, you may use your mojo to resist a consequence of suspicion or social faux pas, or to push yourself when talking your way out of a tight spot or driving under pressure.","class":"Swinger","class_default":"Swinger","price":"1","purchased":false},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"permission":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"7e7b8161cc0ff7b6","name":"Future Shock","type":"ability","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"You are a visitor from the future, here on an important mission. Your mind starts muddled from the time travel process. Every time you fill your playbook xp, you gain clarity—choose a new Time Traveler trait and a versatile ability from another playbook (reflecting your former life and experiences), and take another temporal glitch, and note down a new detail of your mission. You burn brightly but briefly. Make the most of your time here.","class":"Time Traveler Future","class_default":"Time Traveler Future","price":"1","purchased":false},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"permission":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"78153460bedd0a58","name":"Advanced Combat Reflexes","type":"ability","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"Cybernetic implants and futuristic combat training let you react to threats in a fraction of a second and even dodge bullets. Your bare hands count as a fine weapon. When there's a question about who acts first, the answer is you.","class":"Time Traveler Future","class_default":"Time Traveler Future","price":"1","purchased":false},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"permission":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"dcf8f4170edc4b5e","name":"Psionics","type":"ability","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"When you push yourself, you can also do one of the following: communicate without words—view another location clairvoyantly—temporarily increase your strength and speed—mentally interface with technology.","class":"Time Traveler Future","class_default":"Time Traveler Future","price":"1","purchased":false},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"permission":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"330470bc481196f4","name":"Pocket Dimension","type":"ability","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"Take 2 Instability to step out of this timeline for a few minutes, disappearing instantly before reappearing in the same place. Take 1 Instability for each additional feature: it lasts for up to an hour rather than a few minutes—you reappear in a visible location of your choice—you also take anyone you're touching.","class":"Time Traveler Future","class_default":"Time Traveler Future","price":"1","purchased":false},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"permission":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"c91dc73f260fcb9d","name":"Multi-Dimensional","type":"ability","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"Unmoored in time, you can tap into the knowledge and experiences of yourself from alternate timelines. Attune to instantly \"remember\" a new skill or experience (e.g. piloting an airship, speaking another language, knowing how to relate to wealthy aristocrats).","class":"","class_default":"","price":"1","purchased":false},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"permission":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"5fe2100a30f1d9f5","name":"Quantum Displacement","type":"ability","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"Take 1 Instability to teleport anywhere you can see.","class":"Time Traveler Future","class_default":"Time Traveler Future","price":"1","purchased":false},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"permission":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"0cbb136e161d7d9a","name":"Save and Reload","type":"ability","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"Take 5 Instability to rewind the timeline of your physical body to a pre-injured state. Clear all harm.","class":"Time Traveler Future","class_default":"Time Traveler Future","price":"1","purchased":false},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"permission":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"2cd29d5c1b9a107b","name":"Haunted by the Past","type":"ability","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"You are a visitor from the past, here on an important mission. Your mind starts muddled from the time travel process. Every time you fill your playbook xp, you gain clarity—choose a new Time Traveler trait and an ability from one of the Blades in the Dark playbooks, and take another temporal glitch, and note down a new detail of your mission. You burn brightly but briefly. Make the most of your time here.","class":"Time Traveler Past","class_default":"Time Traveler Past","price":"1","purchased":false},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"permission":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"e96c166bc56064f2","name":"Ancient Martial Techniques","type":"ability","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"You have been trained in mystical combat arts lost to time. Your bare hands count as a fine weapon. When there's a question about who acts first, the answer is you.","class":"Time Traveler Past","class_default":"Time Traveler Past","price":"1","purchased":false},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"permission":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"a57131471171b234","name":"Sorcery","type":"ability","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"When you push yourself, you can also do one of the following: communicate without words—view another location clairvoyantly—temporarily increase your strength and speed—supernaturally interface with electroplasmic technology.","class":"Time Traveler Past","class_default":"Time Traveler Past","price":"1","purchased":false},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"permission":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"26e20834c24922bb","name":"Step into the Void","type":"ability","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"Take 2 Instability to step out of this timeline for a few minutes, disappearing instantly before reappearing in the same place. Take 1 Instability for each additional feature: it lasts for up to an hour rather than a few minutes—you reappear in a visible location of your choice—you also take anyone you're touching.","class":"Time Traveler Past","class_default":"Time Traveler Past","price":"1","purchased":false},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"permission":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"e85b2562b8c1a873","name":"Shadow Walk","type":"ability","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"Take 1 Instability to teleport anywhere you can see.","class":"Time Traveler Past","class_default":"Time Traveler Past","price":"1","purchased":false},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"permission":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"e75c1cbaa5c7a678","name":"Resurrection of the Flesh","type":"ability","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"Take 5 Instability to reverse the timeline of your physical body to a pre-injured state. Clear all harm.","class":"Time Traveler Past","class_default":"Time Traveler Past","price":"1","purchased":false},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"permission":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"0d45184d2bef4ea1","name":"Vampire","type":"ability","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"You are a resonance echo who animates an undying body. Your deadlocks are maxed out. Choose four that reflect your vampiric nature. Paranormal attacks are potent against you. If you suffer mortal harm or another deadlock, you are overwhelmed. You take level 3 harm: \"Incapacitated\" until you feed enough to recover. If you suffer paranormal harm while in this state, you are destroyed utterly. Your xp tracks are longer (you now advance more slowly). You have more Stress boxes.","class":"Vampire","class_default":"Vampire","price":"1","purchased":false},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"permission":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"c8ec39e3998f2b16","name":"Terrible Power","type":"ability","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"Take 1 Stress to perform a feat of superhuman strength or speed (run faster than an autopod, bend steel with bare hands, leap onto the roof of a building, etc.). This factors into effect.","class":"Vampire","class_default":"Vampire","price":"1","purchased":false},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"permission":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"51fd2dfdd81cf175","name":"Telepathy","type":"ability","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"Take 1 Stress to sense beyond human limits. Read a subject's true thoughts or feelings, see in pitch darkness, sense the presence of invisible things, intuit the location of a hidden object, etc.","class":"Vampire","class_default":"Vampire","price":"1","purchased":false},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"permission":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"88f4391c9b1c7230","name":"Resonance Void","type":"ability","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"You are invisible to resonance entities and may not be harmed by them. Take 2 Stress to cause living things to avert their gaze and fail to observe you for a few moments.","class":"Vampire","class_default":"Vampire","price":"1","purchased":false},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"permission":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"d1d7761d07b32e9e","name":"Dark Majesty","type":"ability","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"Choose Insight, Prowess, or Resolve. Your max rating for actions under that attribute becomes 5. When you take this ability, add +1 dot to the resistance rating of the attribute you've chosen.","class":"Vampire","class_default":"Vampire","price":"1","purchased":false},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"permission":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"2badfc3a7809b4de","name":"Sinister Guile","type":"ability","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"During downtime, choose one: get a free additional downtime activity, or take +1d to all downtime activity rolls.","class":"Vampire","class_default":"Vampire","price":"1","purchased":false},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"permission":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"10b7a589d7ff767d","name":"Feral Whispers","type":"ability","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"You can Attune to animals to have them do your bidding.","class":"Vampire","class_default":"Vampire","price":"1","purchased":false},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"permission":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"9880cdcabc0a7899","name":"Military Discipline","type":"ability","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"Twice per score, you may use your training to resist harm from an attack in combat or to push yourself during a fight.","class":"Veteran","class_default":"Veteran","price":"1","purchased":false},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"permission":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"63aa3c62419a0552","name":"Got Your Back","type":"ability","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"When you protect a teammate, clear 1 Stress and take +1d to any resistance rolls.","class":"Veteran","class_default":"Veteran","price":"1","purchased":false},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"permission":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"1cfc72b287b188f3","name":"Echo Fighter","type":"ability","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"Thanks to special training, you may engage enemies in combat with nothing but your mind. You gain potency in combat vs. the paranormal. You can attempt to read people’s next intentions.","class":"Veteran","class_default":"Veteran","price":"1","purchased":false},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"permission":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"5ff891c2ab086bb6","name":"Leadership","type":"ability","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"When you Command a cohort in combat, they continue to fight when they would otherwise break (they're not taken out when they suffer level 3 harm). They gain increased effect and 1 armor.","class":"Veteran","class_default":"Veteran","price":"1","purchased":false},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"permission":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"a1cfeeeb973124f2","name":"Walking Arsenal","type":"ability","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"Your load limit is always 2 higher than normal (5 for a Quiet approach, 8 for Loud). Pull out another 1-load gun at any time, no matter how many you’ve already used. Each additional gun of its type (after the first) is 0 load.","class":"Veteran","class_default":"Veteran","price":"1","purchased":false},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"permission":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"a3ee420cb00f1945","name":"War Machine","type":"ability","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"When you push yourself, you can also do one of the following: sweep and secure a large area single-handedly and without pausing—engage an improbable number of enemies in a ballet of violence.","class":"Veteran","class_default":"Veteran","price":"1","purchased":false},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"permission":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"a8beba648c02055b","name":"Get Back In There","type":"ability","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"You were subject to experimental procedures designed to increase the shelf life of frontline soldiers. Permanently fill in one of your healing clock segments. Take +1d to healing treatment rolls.","class":"Veteran","class_default":"Veteran","price":"1","purchased":false},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"permission":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"febef6cb911e3176","name":"Creative Community","type":"ability","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"description":"You gain a second vice: learning a new creative hobby. What is it? When you indulge this vice by going to class, add +2 to the result, and then create a new friend or rival (classmate or teacher), or develop your relationship with an existing one. These people have no criminal utility, but they might give you a ride or let you lay low at their place in a pinch. When you overindulge, one of these friends is put in danger.","class":"Veteran","class_default":"Veteran","price":"1","purchased":false},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"permission":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
